---
Uninstall skills (removes from manifest and local installation)

Usage: fastskill skill remove [OPTIONS] [skill-ids]...

Arguments:
  [skill-ids]...  Skill IDs to remove

Options:
  -f, --force                    Force removal without confirmation
      --global                   Use global skills directory (~/.config/fastskill/skills)
      --skills-dir <skills-dir>  Skills directory path (overrides default discovery)
      --reindex                  Trigger reindex after removal (overrides config)
  -v, --verbose                  Enable verbose output
      --no-reindex               Skip reindex after removal
      --dry-run                  Validate and preview without changing managed state
      --json                     Emit one machine-readable lifecycle result
  -h, --help                     Print help
  -V, --version                  Print version

Syntax: skill remove <SKILL_ID>... [OPTIONS]

Examples:
  fastskill skill remove pptx
  fastskill skill remove pptx docx --force
